Enhanced Knowledge Sphere in Babylon.js
The goal is to create a visually appealing knowledge sphere with:
	•	A central sphere using a Node Material for a dynamic, glowing effect.
	•	Surrounding nodes (smaller spheres) and edges (tubes) representing a knowledge graph.
	•	Interactivity (e.g., clicking nodes to display info, hovering for tooltips).
	•	Data fetched from a Java backend using java.io to read a JSON file.
	•	Optimizations for performance (e.g., instanced meshes for nodes).
